---
import BaseLayout from "../../../components/layout/BaseLayout.astro";
import MetaPill from "../../../components/ui/MetaPill.astro";
import registry from "../../../data/phase-80-public-investment-portfolios-transition-pathways-place-based-capacity-registry.json";

const theses = registry.public_investment_mission_thesis_dossiers;
const portfolios = registry.portfolio_membership_dependency_sequence_registers;
const capacities = registry.place_based_delivery_capacity_transition_ledgers;
const realizations = registry.portfolio_stress_rebalancing_realization_ledgers;
---

<BaseLayout title="Public Investment Portfolios And Place-Based Capacity | FTFN" description="Eight inactive investment theses, eight portfolio-sequence registers, eight delivery-capacity and just-transition ledgers, and eight stress-rebalancing-realization ledgers.">
  <section class="page-section hero" data-investment-portfolio-registry><div class="hero__copy"><div class="eyebrow">FTFN / Public Investment</div><h1 class="page-title">A project list is not a portfolio, and delivery is not realized public value.</h1><p class="lede">Phase 80 separates mission and investment theses, portfolio membership, dependencies, sequencing, funding, financing, delivery institutions, workforce and supplier readiness, land-water-energy constraints, place-based obligations, just transition, off-ramps, stress rebalancing, and public-value realization.</p><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label="8 inactive investment theses" tone="possibility" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive portfolio registers" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive capacity ledgers" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive realization ledgers" /><MetaPill label="0 portfolio decisions" tone="review" /></div></div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Mission And Thesis</div><h2>Eight public-investment theses remain closed.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/public-investment-doctrine-001/">Read the investment doctrine</a></div><div class="grid">{theses.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label={record.thesis_state} tone="review" /><MetaPill label="12 mission classes" /></div><h3><a href={'/evidence/investment-portfolios/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Mission, need, additionality, alternatives, distribution, capacity, resource limits, funding, financing, options, review, and receipts remain inactive.</p></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Portfolio And Sequence</div><h2>Eight membership and sequence registers contain no portfolio.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/portfolio-construction-without-ranking-001/">Read the portfolio method</a></div><div class="grid">{portfolios.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label={record.portfolio_state} tone="review" /><MetaPill label="12 sequence stages" /></div><h3><a href={'/evidence/investment-portfolios/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.portfolio_membership_dependency_sequence_register_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Membership, exclusions, dependencies, critical paths, sequence, stage gates, instruments, capacity, distribution, and transition duties remain empty.</p></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Capacity And Transition</div><h2>Eight place-based delivery ledgers remain inactive.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/place-based-value-just-transition-001/">Read the place and transition method</a></div><div class="source-list">{capacities.map((record) => <article class="source-row"><div><h3><a href={'/evidence/investment-portfolios/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.place_based_delivery_capacity_transition_ledger_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Owner, institutional, workforce, supplier, public-option, land, water, energy, material, housing, community, transition, and readiness findings remain unmade.</p></div><MetaPill label={record.readiness_decision} tone="review" /></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Stress And Realization</div><h2>Eight rebalancing and realization ledgers contain no decision.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/portfolio-stress-rebalancing-concentration-001/">Read the portfolio stress method</a></div><div class="grid">{realizations.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><h3><a href={'/evidence/investment-portfolios/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.portfolio_stress_rebalancing_realization_ledger_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Scenarios, concentration, stress tests, triggers, options, off-ramps, rebalancing, outputs, outcomes, public value, correction, and review remain inactive.</p><MetaPill label={record.realization_state} tone="review" /></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section briefing-band"><div class="briefing-band__copy"><div class="eyebrow">Public Contract</div><h2>Inspect the empty public-investment state.</h2><p>The export publishes mission, thesis, membership, dependency, sequence, instrument, capacity, workforce, supplier, resource, place, transition, stress, rebalancing, and realization controls. It contains no selected project, priority, funding, financing, allocation, finding, receipt, score, rank, or stage change.</p></div><article class="record-card"><a class="inline-link" href="/data/public-investment-portfolios-transition-capacity.json">Public investment portfolios JSON</a></article></section>
</BaseLayout>
